    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2200 = Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of W22 SNOMED CT 217848007 with place= and activity=.
        Target (Athena 441192) =. Best available standard concept: W22 base crosswalk target, fully
        subsumes the source mechanism. Sibling W2209 (home + unspecified activity) -> 4319710
        (stationary object); activity-specific siblings diverge (W2201/2202 -> 432788, W2204 ->
        4312316). For no closer stationary-object variant exists; the W22 (441192) is the legitimate
        ancestor. Broader: target subsumes mechanism axis. moderate: crosswalk follow from base
        W22->441192, not independently re-verified.
        """
}
