mapping "W2230.1" source="W2230" target="217848007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2230 (ICD-10-SE) = SNOMED CT 217848007: struck by/against other object(s) at a sports
        venue, while doing sport/exercise. This is a Swedish 7-character extension of WHO ICD-10 W22
        (Striking against or struck by other object(s)). The WHO parent W22 (Athena concept 45756260)
        carries a crosswalk to SNOMED CT 441192 (concept_code 217848007, standard concept, Observation
        domain). The Swedish extension subdivides W22 by place and activity; no SNOMED CT concept exists at
        that combined granularity. Target 441192 fully subsumes every W22.XXX place/activity variant
        (source is a child of the parent the target represents), so this is a one-level broader map with
        a verified crosswalk. Confidence per rubric §1 (high).
        """
}
